        "filing_date": "2026-02-17",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In addition to internal development, we work with leading research institutions, universities and clinicians around the world to develop, evaluate and clinically test our products.",
        "start_character": 17574,
        "end_character": 17754
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0000885725-26-000010",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0000885725-26-000010-70a6c3f2d728876a",
        "accession_number": "0000885725-26-000010",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-17",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In doing so, we seek to focus our internal resources on the development and commercial launch of new products and the enhancement of existing products.",
        "start_character": 19715,
        "end_character": 19866
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0000885725-26-000010",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0000885725-26-000010-70a6c3f2d728876a",
        "accession_number": "0000885725-26-000010",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-17",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Through our international presence, we seek to increase net sales and market share, leverage our relationships with leading physicians and their clinical research programs, accelerate the time to bring new products to market and gain access to worldwide technological developments that we can implement across our product lines.",
        "start_character": 1885,
        "end_character": 2213
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0000885725-26-000010",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0000885725-26-000010-70a6c3f2d728876a",
        "accession_number": "0000885725-26-000010",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-17",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We also have a network of distributors and dealers who offer our products in certain countries and markets.",
        "start_character": 18716,
        "end_character": 18823
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0000885725-26-000010",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0000885725-26-000010-70a6c3f2d728876a",
        "accession_number": "0000885725-26-000010",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-17",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "In the current environment of managed care, with economically motivated buyers, consolidation among health care providers, increasing prevalence and importance of regional and national tenders, increased competition and declining reimbursement rates, we are also required to compete on the basis of price, value, reliability and efficiency.",
        "start_character": 15225,
        "end_character": 15565
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0000885725-26-000010",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0000885725-26-000010-70a6c3f2d728876a",
        "accession_number": "0000885725-26-000010",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-17",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "The medical devices that we manufacture, market and commercialize are subject to regulation by numerous worldwide regulatory bodies, including the FDA in the United States, the European Medicines Agency (EMA) in Europe and other comparable international regulatory agencies.",
        "start_character": 24841,
        "end_character": 25115
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0000885725-26-000010",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0000885725-26-000010-70a6c3f2d728876a",
        "accession_number": "0000885725-26-000010",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-17",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We also encounter competition from the entry of low-cost manufacturers, which may lead to increased pricing pressure.",
        "start_character": 14276,
        "end_character": 14393
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0000885725-26-000010",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0000885725-26-000010-70a6c3f2d728876a",
        "accession_number": "0000885725-26-000010",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-17",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We also support Science, Technology, Engineering and Mathematics (STEM) education initiatives designed to engage underrepresented students through employee-led outreach.",
        "start_character": 41030,
        "end_character": 41199
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0000885725-26-000010",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0000885725-26-000010-70a6c3f2d728876a",
        "accession_number": "0000885725-26-000010",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-17",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We are focused on continuously improving our supply chain effectiveness, strengthening our manufacturing processes and increasing operational efficiencies within our organization worldwide.",
        "start_character": 19525,
        "end_character": 19714
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0000885725-26-000010",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0000885725-26-000010-70a6c3f2d728876a",
        "accession_number": "0000885725-26-000010",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-17",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We collaborate with nonprofit organizations to support health education, workforce development and efforts to reduce health disparities.",
        "start_character": 40704,
        "end_character": 40840
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0000885725-26-000010",
